# diskcache 5.6.3: transitive via litellm, no fix released upstream
CVE-2025-69872

# filelock 3.32.7: transitive via litellm (pins filelock<4.0), fix only in 4.2.1.
# litellm lifts the cap in BerriAI/litellm#49137, not in a stable release yet.
# Not exploitable here: all need a second local user or Windows, and the HIGH one
# needs ReadWriteLock, which nothing we ship uses. Drop once litellm allows 4.2.1.
